**Problem**: Count ways to cut a 1×1 square into 8 congruent polygonal pieces with interior angles 45° or 90°.

**Standard solution approach**:
- Identifies only triangles (1/2×1/2 right isosceles) and two rectangle types (1×1/8 and 1/2×1/4) as possible
- Triangle case: 16 ways (2 choices per quadrant)
- 1×1/8 rectangles: 2 ways (horizontal/vertical)
- 1/2×1/4 rectangles: 36 ways (via quadrant-spanning enumeration)
- Total: 16 + 2 + 36 = 54

